  "arduino": "// Ideal A4988 driver: ENABLE defaults LOW; RESET and SLEEP must be HIGH.\n// Real motors need a suitable motor supply and driver current limit.\nvoid setup() { pinMode(2, OUTPUT); pinMode(3, OUTPUT); }\nvoid loop() {\n  for (byte direction = 0; direction < 2; direction++) {\n    digitalWrite(3, direction);\n    for (int step = 0; step < 200; step++) {\n      digitalWrite(2, HIGH); delayMicroseconds(5);\n      digitalWrite(2, LOW); delay(5);\n    }\n    delay(400);\n  }\n}\n",
